## Purpose

This document forms part of the Tanasiom Aegis Cyber Essentials Readiness Framework, a project developed to assist Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises (SMEs) in assessing, improving, and demonstrating readiness for Cyber Essentials certification.

The contents of this document support the implementation, assessment, evaluation, or management of cybersecurity controls aligned with Cyber Essentials requirements and National Cyber Security Centre (NCSC) guidance.

